<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <title>Iscrizioni</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/subscriptionCSS.css">

</head>

<body>
<div class="col-md-6 offset-md-3 text-center">
    <h2>Accesso Privato</h2>
    <p>Il canale a cui stai cercando di accedere è privato.</p>

    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
        <form action="/iscrizione" method="post">
            <input type="hidden" name="channelName" value="<%= channelName %>">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mr-2">Iscriviti</button>

        </form>

        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Home</a>
    </div>
</div>


<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>